10. KEY OBSERVATIONS
Architecture Pattern
Configuration-driven: All settings in JSON files
Multilingual: English/French support via [...lang] routing
Static-first: Astro components with selective React hydration
Collection-based: All content managed through Astro Content Collections
Component Hierarchy
Base.astro (root layout)├── Header.astro│   ├── Logo.astro → ImageMod.astro│   ├── ThemeSwitcher.astro│   └── LanguageSwitcher.tsx (React)├── Announcement.tsx (React)├── SearchModal.tsx (React)│   └── SearchResult.tsx (React)├── <Page Content>│   ├── PageHeader.astro → Breadcrumbs.astro│   ├── BlogCard.astro → ImageMod.astro│   ├── AuthorCard.astro → ImageMod.astro, Social.astro│   ├── Pagination.astro│   └── PostSidebar.astro└── Footer.astro    ├── Logo.astro    └── Social.astro → DynamicIcon.tsx
Most Reused Components
ImageMod.astro - Used in 15+ locations
BlogCard.astro - Used in 6 page types
PageHeader.astro - Used in 5+ page types
Base.astro - Wraps all pages
React vs Astro Split
Astro Components: Static content, layout, UI structure
React Components: Interactive features (search, language switcher, theme toggle, comments)
Hydration Strategy: client:load for immediate interactivity
Multilingual Implementation
URL structure: / (default), /en/, /fr/
Content organized by language folders
Separate menu files per language
UI translations in i18n/ folder
All routes support language parameter via [...lang]
